Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/opt_chain_method.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     val c: Cell? = null;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/opt_chain_method.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     val z = c?.show();
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0046]: optional chaining `?.` only reaches fields, not methods
  --> tests/ui/opt_chain_method.jet:6:16
    |
  6 |     val z = c?.show();
    |                ^^^^
 Why: `a?.b` short-circuits a `T?` to absent; calling through `?.` isn't in yet
 Fix: unwrap first, e.g. `(a ?? return).method()`, or test with `== present`
